  "body": "There's something special about a home that gives everyone room to enjoy life in their own way. With peaceful bush views, generous proportions and a thoughtfully arranged layout, this brand-new Stanmore Bay residence brings together the comforts of modern living and the flexibility that growing families appreciate. Positioned on approximately 447sqm of freehold land with a substantial 213.8sqm floor area, it offers four bedrooms, three bathrooms and a double internal-access garage, with the added advantage of excellent granny potential.\r\n\r\nThe upper level is designed around a wonderful sense of openness, where the kitchen, dining and living spaces flow together to create a relaxed and welcoming atmosphere. Whether it's a quiet morning coffee, a family dinner or an evening with friends, there's plenty of room to enjoy the moment. The modern kitchen is both stylish and practical, complete with an oven, built-in microwave and walk-in pantry, while the dining area connects effortlessly to the outdoor deck. Beautiful bush views from the living area add a refreshing touch of greenery, creating a lovely setting to unwind at the end of the day.\r\n\r\nTucked away from the main living spaces, the master bedroom enjoys its own peaceful outlook across the greenery. Two walk-in wardrobes provide excellent storage, complemented by a private ensuite for added comfort. Two further bedrooms and a family bathroom complete the upper level, offering a practical arrangement for everyday family life.\r\n\r\nWhat makes this home particularly appealing is the flexibility offered downstairs. A generous bedroom with a walk-in wardrobe sits alongside a separate sitting area and full bathroom, creating a comfortable space for extended family, guests or older children. This natural separation between the two levels provides excellent granny potential, allowing different generations to enjoy their own space while remaining connected under one roof.\r\n\r\nAdditional Features:\r\n- Underfloor heating in the bathrooms\r\n- Double internal-access garage with additional storage\r\n- Pre-wired EV charger\r\n- 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nLife in Stanmore Bay offers a wonderful balance of coastal relaxation and everyday convenience. Spend weekends exploring the beaches of the Whangaparaoa Peninsula, enjoy nearby parks and recreational facilities, or make the most of the local cafés, schools and shopping options. Coast Plaza is conveniently accessible, with Silverdale providing further retail and lifestyle amenities. The upcoming Penlink connection is also expected to improve access to the wider Auckland region.\r\n\r\nWith its generous living spaces, peaceful green outlook and the freedom to accommodate different family needs, this is a home that offers more than just space - it offers the opportunity to enjoy family life on your own terms.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing and experience everything this beautiful new home has to offer.",
